values ('fq_conc_060', 'The Abyss Harbinger', 'boss', 'S', 'CONCORDIUM', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'THE FINAL VOID TRIAL. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, Officer Valen) The Abyss Harbinger has fully awakened. As Concordium''s foremost operative, you must descend into the deepest chasm and destroy the Raid Boss Tier-2 entity. The fate of Xylos hangs in the balance. Progress through Unity. Victory through Strength.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 59, "reputation_required": 3480, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_059"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ABYSS_HARBINGER", "count": 1, "description": "DEFEAT THE ABYSS HARBINGER. [Abyss Harbinger]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "void_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect void core (x1). [Item: Void Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 15000, "currency": 7500, "crd": 3750, "rep": 5000, "items": [{"item_id": "void_core", "quantity": 5}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "con_elite_recovery_pack", "quantity": 10}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_061', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 59)
