values ('fq_conc_070', 'The Gravity Titan Rises', 'boss', 'S', 'CONCORDIUM', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'MAXIMUM PRIORITY ALERT. The Gravity Titan has risen from beneath the Cradle Expanse. This Raid Boss Tier-3 entity can manipulate gravity itself. If it reaches full power, Xylos''s gravity field will collapse. You are the only operative capable of stopping it. THE CONCORDIUM COMMANDS YOU TO VICTORY. Quest giver: Officer Valen at Nexus Core Command Post.', '{"npc_id": "npc_concordium_officer", "name": "", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 69, "reputation_required": 4080, "required_quests": ["fq_conc_069"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "description": "DEFEAT THE GRAVITY TITAN. [Gravity Titan]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "description": "Clear the Titan''s Abyssal escorts. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "void_channeler_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect void channeler core (x1). [Item: Void Channeler Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 20000, "currency": 10000, "crd": 5000, "rep": 7000, "items": [{"item_id": "titan_core", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "gravity_well_core", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_conc_071', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_concordium.json', 69)
