values ('fq_iron_008', 'A Lesson in Superior Force', 'story', 'D', 'IRON_HEGEMONY', 'IRON_RAVINE', 'An Iron Ravine Brute has claimed the central shaft as its territory and crushed three of the Hegemony''s initial mining crews — not out of intelligence but pure animal dominance. Warlord Steele has a complicated respect for dominant animals; they understand, on instinct, what the Concordium''s diplomats will never accept. But respect does not mean tolerance. The Ravine belongs to the Hegemony. Show the Brute what superior force looks like from the losing side. Quest giver: Commander Drax at Bastion Core Command Bunker.', '{"npc_id": "npc_hegemony_commander", "name": "Warlord Harkon Steele", "location": "IRON_RAVINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 7, "reputation_required": 30, "required_quests": ["fq_iron_007"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "IRON_RAVINE_BRUTE", "count": 2, "desc": "Defeat Iron Ravine Brutes.", "description": "Defeat Iron Ravine Brute (x2)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "metal_shard", "count": 1, "desc": "Claim the Brute''s weapon as trophy.", "description": "Collect metal shard (x1). [Item: Metal Shard]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 180, "currency": 100, "crd": 0, "rep": 100, "items": [{"item_id": "rusted_plate", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_iron_009', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_iron.json', 7)
