values ('fq_iron_070', 'Toppling the Titan', 'boss', 'S', 'IRON_HEGEMONY', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'MAXIMUM PRIORITY: OPERATION TITANFALL. (Location: Cradle Expanse, Commander Drax) The Gravity Titan threatens to collapse Xylos. The Iron Hegemony will topple it. This is the largest military engagement in Hegemony history. Every soldier. Every tank. Every ounce of steel. BRING IT DOWN.', '{"npc_id": "npc_hegemony_commander", "name": "Commander Drax", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 69, "reputation_required": 4080, "required_quests": ["fq_iron_069"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "desc": "TOPPLE THE GRAVITY TITAN.", "description": "Defeat Gravity Titan (x1)."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "desc": "Clear Abyssal escorts.", "description": "Defeat Aethel Abyssal Reaver (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 1, "desc": "Secure the Titan Core for Hegemony weapons research.", "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x1). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 20000, "currency": 10000, "crd": 5000, "rep": 7000, "items": [{"item_id": "titan_core", "quantity": 3}, {"item_id": "gravity_well_core", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_iron_071', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_iron.json', 69)
